## AMA and speaker posts

Speaker announcements and AMA banners for X (Twitter) Spaces and conference meetups. They repeat a template: brand colours, speaker photos and clear date and time details.

![A set of AMA banners and speaker posts](/work/quillaudits/ama-speaker-posts.webp "AMA banners and speaker posts")

## Learnings

A grid, a palette and a small set of base shapes did more for consistency than any single hero piece. Once they were in place, I could make new icons and banners quickly without each one drifting from the brand. Event work was the opposite: each event needed its own mood. The challenge there was letting the theme lead while keeping enough of the brand that every piece still read as QuillAudits.
